  "notes": "Inputs 1-2 are combo XLR/6.35 mm jack: mic on XLR, line or instrument (INST) on jack. Kensington lock not listed. USB bus-powered. Routing: Direct Monitor sends the inputs straight to the outputs; inputs reach the computer via USB. Controls from the user guide, 'Front Panel': GAIN, INST and AIR per input, one 48V switch for both inputs, MONITOR (main output level), DIRECT MONITOR OFF/MONO/STEREO and headphone level. As the guide states, with DIRECT MONITOR in MONO both inputs go to both outputs and the headphones; in STEREO input 1 goes left and input 2 right; OFF = monitoring via the computer only. Assumption: MONITOR and headphone level at MIN are silent.",
